    "name": "EBD - Property Owner Service",
    "description": "Postman collection generated from the latest property-owner-service source code.\n\nBase URL: http://localhost:8069\nAuthentication: Bearer JWT inherited from collection variable {{accessToken}}.\n\nRecommended flow:\n1. Set accessToken to a valid Keycloak JWT.\n2. Create Property Owner (ownerId is captured automatically).\n3. Get My Owner Profile / Update Owner.\n4. Add owner documents (documentId is captured automatically).\n5. Submit for verification.\n6. Use an authorized platform/admin token for verify/reject/suspend operations.\n\nImportant: Create Property Owner does not accept userId. The service obtains the current user UUID from the authenticated JWT through CurrentUserReader.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "3813273"
  },
